Z"},"body":"- Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/95471 \r\n- Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104554 (probably)\r\n- Fixes clicking and dragging from the line fold gutter or breakpoint gutter extends a selection from the previous caret position. (The line number gutter still starts line selection mode).\r\n- Fixes triple-clicking line selection mode with multiple selections.\r\n- Fixes selecting continues when alt tabbing and mouse is released.\r\n\r\nClicking on the TextEdit while there is a popup open now does nothing in the TextEdit (when embed subwindows is off), which is normal behavior for Controls.\r\n\r\nI made the `_update_selection_mode_pointer` now use the word begin/end column, since it is now possible to start a word selection (double click) and then change it to a regular selection with shift+click. Otherwise, if the selection is extended above the word, the word would not be selected anymore. I used the selection origin determining code from `_update_selection_mode_word` for this.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url"